<title>FINLAND: MERITA'S 2001 BOND AUCTION RAISES FIM 190 MILLION.</title>
<headline>MERITA'S 2001 BOND AUCTION RAISES FIM 190 MILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Merita Bank </p>
<p>announced the following issue of its 2001 bond:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Merita Bank</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-09-2001</p>
<p> COUPON:				 5.50 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			5.05 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  101.79</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 190 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 305 MLN</p>
<p>NOTES: After this auction, the outstanding amount is 543</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 353 million markka</p>
<p>at a price of 99.85 and a yield of 5.53 percent.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 6805 0240</p>
</text>
